2 CONT 1.         ALIX (-murdered 1329).  The Chronique du Royaume de la Petite Arménie of Constable Sempad records the marriage in [31 Dec 1320/30 Dec 1321] of "le jeune fils d'Oschin, Léon" and "la fille d'Oschin comte de Gorigos, bail
2 CONC e d'Arménie"[1062].  The Chronicle of Jean Dardel records the marriage of "le…baron Ossin…sa fille…Aalips" and "[le] roy Lyon le quart"[1063].  The Chronicle of Jean Dardel records that King Lewon killed "sa femme, dame Aaleps" wh
2 CONC en he reached the age of majority "pour la deshonneste vie qu'elle menoit"[1064].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (Papal Dispensation 10 Aug 1321) as his first wife, her first cousin, LEWON IV King of Armenia, son of OSHIN King of Armenia & his first wife Zabel of Korikos (before 4 Sep 1309-28 Aug 1341). 
