2 CONT
2 CONT Juan Alvaro Flores de Valdes
2 CONT *was born in Villa Cangas, Tineo, Oviedo, Spain. 
2 CONT *He married Aldonsa Alfonso Carvallo on Abt. 1539 in Villa Cangas, Tineo, Oviedo, Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Juan Alvaro Flores de Valdes and Aldonsa Alfonso Carvallo:
2 CONT *Marriage: Abt. 1539, Villa Cangas, Tineo, Oviedo, Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Juan Alvaro Flores de Valdes and Aldonsa Alfonso Carvallo are: 
2 CONT *1. +Rodrigo Flores Valdez CARBALLO, Capt. (son of Juan Alvaro Flores de Valdes and Aldonsa Alfonso Carvallo) 
2 CONT **was born Abt. 1540 in Villa Cangas, Tineo, Asturias, Oviedo, Spain. 
2 CONT **He married Maria Isabel de Salazar Trevino DEL VALLE on Abt. 1572 in Villa Cangas, Tineo, Oviedo, Spain, 
2 CONT ***daughter of Pedro de Salazar and Isabel de Quintanilla..
