2 CONT
2 CONT Emanuele Filiberto, Duca di Savoia was born on 8 July 1528 at Chambéry, France. (4) He was the son of Carlo II, Duca di Savoia and Beatriz de Aviz, Infanta de Portugal. (3) He married Marguerite de Valois, Duchesse de Berri, daugh
2 CONC ter of François I, Roi de France and Claude de Valois, Duchesse de Bretagne, in 1559. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 30 August 1580 at age 52. (4)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Emanuele Filiberto, Duca di Savoia succeeded to the title of Duca di Savoia in 1553. (1)
2 CONT
