2 CONC , Louis, Baron de Mezieres 2 . She was born October 21, 1550 3 . Son of absence, his parents left him the whole land: the Marquis of Mezieres, the riding of Saint-Fargeau and the lordships of Mareuil and Villebois .
2 CONT
