2 CONT '''Countess of Soissons (1550–1562)'''
2 CONT Marriages and children
2 CONT '''In 1541 Jeanne married William, Duke of Jülich-Berg-Ravensberg-Kleve-Mark, a marriage that was annulled in 1545 by Pope Paul III,[31] with no children.'''
2 CONT '''On 20 October 1548, she married Antoine de Bourbon, Duke of Vendôme[32] and they had:'''
2 CONT 1. Henri de Bourbon, Duke of Beaumont (1551–1553)
2 CONT 2. Henri de Bourbon (Henry III of Navarre and IV of France) (13 December 1553 – 14 May 1610) married Margaret of Valois but had no children.[4] Remarried Marie de' Medici in 1600 and had issue.[4]
2 CONT 3. Louis Charles de Bourbon, Count of Marle (1555–1557)
2 CONT 4. Madeleine de Bourbon (1556-1556)[33]
2 CONT 5. Catherine de Bourbon (7 February 1559 – 13 February 1604), also known as Catherine of Navarre, who married Henry, Hereditary Prince of Lorraine in 1599.[4]
2 CONT etc.
2 CONT From: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jeanne_d%27Albret
