2 CONT '''     Jeanne III d' Albret Queen of Navarre, Princess of Bearn was born on 7 January 1528 at Pau.1 She married Antoine de Bourbon, 2nd Duke of Vendome, King of Navarre''', son of Sir Charles IV de Bourbon, Duke of Vendome, Count
2 CONC  of Soissons, Marle, Conversano and Francoise d' Alencon, '''on 20 October 1548 at Moulins, France.1 Jeanne III d' Albret Queen of Navarre, Princess of Bearn died on 9 June 1572 at Paris, France, at age 44; Buried at St. Georges, 
2 CONC Vendome.'''1
