2 CONT  Marguerite de Valois, Duchesse de Berri was born on 5 June 1523. (3) She was the daughter of François I, Roi de France and Claude de Valois, Duchesse de Bretagne. She married Emanuele Filiberto, Duca di Savoia, son of Carlo II, D
2 CONC uca di Savoia and Beatriz de Aviz, Infanta de Portugal, in 1559. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 14 September 1574 at age 51. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Marguerite de Valois, Duchesse de Berri gained the title of Duchesse de Berri.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Marguerite de Valois, Duchesse de Berri and Emanuele Filiberto, Duca di Savoia
