2 CONT '''     Antoine de Bourbon, 2nd Duke of Vendome, King of Navarre was born on 22 April 1518 at Chateau de La Fere, France.1 He married Jeanne III d' Albret Queen of Navarre, Princess of Bearn''', daughter of Henri II d' Albret, Kin
2 CONC g of Navarre, Comte de Foix & Bigorre and Marguerite d' Orleans, Duchess d'Alencon & Berry, '''on 20 October 1548 at Moulins, France.2 Antoine de Bourbon, 2nd Duke of Vendome, King of Navarre died on 17 November 1562 at Andelys at
2 CONC  age 44; Killed in battle; buried at St. Georges, Vendome.'''1
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Jeanne III d' Albret Queen of Navarre, Princess of Bearn''' b. 7 Jan 1528, d. 9 Jun 1572
