2 CONT '''René de Guise, Duc de Lorraine-Elboeuf '''
2 CONT M, #42284, '''b. 1536, d. before 14 December 1566'''
2 CONT Last Edited=6 Jan 2009
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.55%
2 CONT '''    René de Guise, Duc de Lorraine-Elboeuf was born in 1536. He was the son''' of Claude de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Antoinette de Bourbon. '''He married Louise d'Harcourt in 1554. He died before 14 December 1566.'''
2 CONT '''     He gained the title of Duc de Lorraine-Elboeuf.'''
2 CONT '''Children of René de Guise, Duc de Lorraine-Elboeuf and Louise d'Harcourt'''
