2 CONC RNARDO DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY and BEATRIZ ROJO-DE-LAS-RUELAS. He was born 1610 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died 22 Jul 1699 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
