2 CONT [edit] Marriages and legitimate childrenMain articles: Descendants of Henry IV of France and Henry IV of France's wives and mistresses On 18 August 1572, Henry married his second cousin Margaret of Valois; their childless marriage
2 CONC  was annulled in 1599. His subsequent marriage to Marie de' Medici on 17 December 1600 produced six children:
2 CONT
