2 CONT      Isabel di Savoia was born on 11 March 1591. She was the daughter of Carlo Emanuele I, Duca di Savoia and Catalina Micaela von Habsburg. She married Alfonso III d'Este, Duca di Modena, son of Cesar d'Este, Duca di Modena and V
2 CONC irginia de Medici, on 22 February 1608. She died on 28 August 1626 at age 35.
