2 CONT ===Controversial descent 
2 CONT
2 CONT *The biggest unknown factor is whether Tomas Francesco is the father at all of "Prince" [https://www.geni.com/people/Francois-Savoie/6000000002834660361 Francois Savoie], and if so, through which alleged mother.
2 CONT
2 CONT The official record for the official marriage to Marie shows no such birth evidence "in wedlock"  A 1621 birth of Francois would be "out of wedlock" by 4 years early.
2 CONT
2 CONT OR...
2 CONT
2 CONT *The other option is as reported that the alleged son of Tomas, Francois reported on his deathbed that he was Tomas' son for whatever that was worth.  Who his mother was is unclear if this is true.  If not Marie Bourbon, then the 
2 CONC unknown partner in a nonmarried relationship hereto known as Mrs. Savoy is the only conclusion.
2 CONT
2 CONT *Controversy not intended here, just historical accuracy.
2 CONT
2 CONT A lot hinges on the paternity and maternity of the alleged son [https://www.geni.com/people/Francois-Savoie/6000000002834660361 “Francois Savoie"] born 1621.
2 CONT
