1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Josepha FLORES63,1675 was born (date unknown). Josepha Flores was a mestiza. According to marriage investigations #7-13 and #7-30 she had an illicit affair with Francisco Gomez Mascorro, who was contracting a marri
2 CONC age with Josepha's half-cousin Juana Flores de Valdes. Josepha and Francisco had their affair after Francisco had already had 2 children during his illicit affair with Juana. It appears that, despite two different marriage investi
2 CONC gations, Francisco Gomez Mascorro never did marry Juana Flores de Valdes, instead marrying Maria Rosa Rodriguez. Parents: Pedro FLORES.
2 CONT
