1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles II Gonzaga From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Charles II Gonzaga (1609-1631) was the son of Charles I, Duke of Mantua and Catherine of Mayenne, he was the Duke of Nevers and Rethel. In December 1627 when
2 CONC  Charles was 18 he married his cousin Maria Gonzaga, the marriage was arranged by Vincenzo II Gonzaga. Charles and Maria had three children: Eleonora (1628-1686), who married in 1651 Ferdinand III, Holy Roman Emperor. Maria Charle
2 CONC s (1629-1665). Charles was never the proper Duke of Mantua since he died ten years before Charles did. When Charles's father died in 1637 Charles's eight year old son became Duke of Mantua, his widow Maria acted as regent. His dau
2 CONC ghter Eleonora became Holy Roman Emperess.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel1 M, #112064, b. 1609, d. 31 August 1631
2 CONT
2 CONT Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel|b. 1609\nd. 31 Aug 1631|p11207.htm#i112064|Carlo I de Gonzaga, 8th Duca di Mantova|b. 6 May 1580\nd. 21 Sep 1637|p11473.htm#i114725|Catherine de Mayenne|b. c 1585\nd. 18 Mar 1618|p4230.htm#i42297|Ludov
2 CONC ico Gonzaga, Duc de Nevers|b. 22 Oct 1539\nd. 23 Oct 1595|p16422.htm#i164215|Henriette de Nevers|b. 31 Oct 1542\nd. 24 Jan 1601|p4301.htm#i43005|Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Mayenne|b. 26 Mar 1554\nd. 4 Oct 1611|p4230.htm#i42292|He
2 CONC nriette de Savoie, Marquise de Villars|b. c 1541\nd. 14 Oct 1611|p4230.htm#i42293|
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=3 Mar 2007 Consanguinity Index=0.64%
2 CONT      Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel was born in 1609.3 He was the son of Carlo I de Gonzaga, 8th Duca di Mantova and Catherine de Mayenne.2,3 He married Maria Gonzaga, Principessa di Mantova, daughter of Francesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Du
2 CONC ca di Mantova and Margherita di Savoia, Principessa di Savoia, on 25 December 1627.3 He died on 31 August 1631 at Cavriana.3
2 CONT      Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel gained the title of Duc de Rethel.1 Children of Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel and Maria Gonzaga, Principessa di Mantova 1.Carlo III Gonzaga, 8th Duca di Mantova+2 b. 3 Oct 1629, d. 14 Aug 1665 2.El
2 CONC eanora Gonzaga Principessa di Mantova+1 b. 18 Nov 1630, d. 6 Dec 1686 Citations 1.[S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and C
2 CONC ompany, 1999), table 80. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succession. 2.[S38] John Morby, Dynasties of the World: a chronological and genealogical handbook (Oxford, Oxfordshire, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 1989), page 107. Hereina
2 CONC fter cited as Dynasties of the World. 3.[S102] Roglo Geneweb Website, online <http://geneweb.inria.fr/roglo?lang=en>. Hereinafter cited as Roglo Geneweb Website.
