2 CONT LOUIS de France, son of HENRI IV King of France & his second wife Maria de' Medici Pss of Tuscany (Château de Fontainebleau 27 Sep 1601-Saint-Germain-en-Laye 14 May 1643, bur Saint-Denis).  Dauphin de France from birth.  He succee
2 CONC ded his father in 1610 as LOUIS XIII King of France and Navarre. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m (by proxy Burgos 18 Oct 1615, in person Bordeaux 24 Nov 1615) Infanta doña ANA of Spain, daughter of FELIPE III King of Spain & his wife Margareta Archduchess of Austria (Valladolid 22 Sep 1601-Louvre 20 Jan 1666, bur Saint-Deni
2 CONC s).  She was known as “Anne d'Autriche” in France.  She was created Duchesse de Bourbon et d'Auvergne, Comtesse de Clermont, de la Marche et de Rodez 12 Oct 1643.  Regent during the minority of her son King Louis XIV from 18 May 1
2 CONC 643 to 7 Sep 1651.  She was called “la Reine-mère” from 7 Jun 1660. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis XIII & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         LOUIS de France (Saint-Germain-en-Laye 5 Sep 1638-Versailles 1 Sep 1715, bur Saint-Denis).  Dauphin de France from birth.  He succeeded his father in 1643 as LOUIS XIV King of France. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         PHILIPPE de France (Saint-Germain-en-Laye 21 Sep 1640-Château de Saint-Cloud 9 Jun 1701, bur Saint-Denis).  Duc d’Anjou from birth.  He was called “Monsieur”.  Duc d’Orléans, de Chartres, de Valois, de Nemours et de Mon
2 CONC tpensier, Prince de Joinville, Comte de Beaujolais, de Dourdan et de Romorantin Mar 1661, following the death of Gaston de France Duc d’Orléans. 
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CAPET.htm#LouisXIIIdied1643B
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''LOUIS II KING OF NAVARRE''' also known as '''LOUIS XIII KING OF FRANCE''' also known as '''CO-PRINCE OF ANDORRA'''
2 CONT
