2 CONT Isabella Clara Eugenia von Habsburg was born in 1566.2 She was the daughter of Felipe II von Habsburg, Rey de España and Elizabeth de Valois, Princesse de France. She married Albrecht Erzherzog von Österreich, son of Maximilian II
2 CONC  von Habsburg, Holy Roman Emperor and Maria von Habsburg, Infanta de España, in 1599.3 She died in 1633.2
