2 CONT Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Guise 1     Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Guise was born in 1571. He was the son of Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Catherine de Nevers. He married Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse in 1611. He died in
2 CONC  1640.
2 CONT      Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Guise gained the title of Duc de Guise. Children of Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse 1.François de Guise b. 1612, d. 1639 2.Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise b. 
2 CONC 1614, d. 1664 3.Marie de Guise b. 1615, d. 1688 4.Charles de Guise b. 1618, d. 1637 5.Françoise de Guise b. 1621, d. 1682 6.Louis de Lorraine, Duc de Joyeuse+ b. 1622, d. 1654 7.Roger de Guise b. 1624, d. 1653 Citations 1.[S3409] 
