1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alfonso IV d'Este, Duca di Modena (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #101400, b. 13 February 1634, d. 16 July 1662
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=30 Sep 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.7%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Alfonso IV d'Este, Duca di Modena was born on 13 February 1634. He is the son of Francesco I d'Este, Duca di Modena and Mary Farnese. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Laura Martinozzi, daughter of Hieronymus Martinozzi and Laura Mazarini, on 27 May 1655. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 16 July 1662 at age 28.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Alfonso IV d'Este, Duca di Modena succeeded to the title of Duca di Modena in 1658. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Alfonso IV d'Este, Duca di Modena and Laura Martinozzi
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Mary Beatrice Eleanora Anne Margaret Isabella d'Este+ b. 5 Oct 1658, d. 7 May 1718 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Alfonso IV d'Este, Duca di Modena
