2 CONC TROPOLITANO,MONTERREY,NUEVO LEON,MEXICO, reference ; FHL microfilm 605,147.  ...  Name: '''Luisa Rodrigues Saenz'''; Gender: Female; '''Christening Date: 27 May 1680'''; '''Christening Place: SAGRARIO METROPOLITANO, MONTERREY, NUE
2 CONC VO LEON, MEXICO'''Father's Name: Franco Rodrigues;  Mother's Name: Maria Saenz
2 CONT
2 CONT '''______________________________'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Luisa RODRIGUEZ959 was born (date unknown). Parents: Francisco RODRIGUEZ de Carabajal and Maria SAENZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Deciderio de la CERDA. Luisa RODRIGUEZ and Deciderio de la CERDA were married after 20 January 1697.959,960  Esther Herold believes this marriage never took place, as she has been unable to locate a marriage record for the
2 CONC m. She did find a marriage record for Deciderio de la Cerda and Leonor Mungia in the Cathedral of Monterrey in 1700.  It is not known why the proposed marriage between Deciderio and Luisa might not have taken place but, considerin
2 CONC g that Deciderio married Leonor Mungia just 3 years later, it is certainly possible that Luisa died before they married, although Esther Herold has not been able to locate a death certificate for Luisa Rodriguez.
2 CONT
