2 CONT 18. MARGARITA-GERTRUDIS4 GUTIERREZ-DE-CASTRO (GERTRUDIS3 DE-LA-GARZA, PEDRO2 FLORES-DE-ABREGO, PEDRO1) was born June 23, 1675 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married ALFEREZ JOSEPH MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-DE-LA-GARZA September 20,
2 CONC  1693 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of JOSEPH MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO and NICOLASA DE-LA-GARZA-DE-LA-ROCHA. He was born August 24, 1668 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for ALFEREZ JOSEPH MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-DE-LA-GARZA:
2 CONT
2 CONT LDS Film #605,181.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARGARITA-GERTRUDIS GUTIERREZ-DE-CASTRO and JOSEPH MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO-DE-LA-GARZA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MARIA DE JESUS JOAQUIN5 GUAJARDO-GUTIERREZ-DE-CAS, b. Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. JOSEPH DE OLIVARES-VELA, June 01, 1730, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1700, Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARIA GUAJARDO-GUTIERREZ-DE-CAS and JOSEPH DE OLIVARES-VELA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, and Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 87.
2 CONT
