2 CONT Christian Louis de Montmorency, Count then Duke of Beaumont (February 9, 1675 – November 23, 1746), prince de Tingry (1695), comte de Luxe, was a Marshal of France (1734).
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the 4th son of Marshal François-Henri de Montmorency, duc de Luxembourg and Madeleine de Clermont.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He played a decisive role in the Battle of Denain in 1712. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Denain
2 CONT
2 CONT  He commissioned in 1722 the building of Hôtel Matignon.
