2 CONT * [http://www.thepeerage.com/p10526.htm#i105257 '''Louis Alexandre de Bourbon, Comte de Toulouse''' ]
2 CONT ===Golden Fleece - Knights: Spanish Branch===
2 CONT * M, #105257, b. 6 June 1678, d. 1 December 1737
2 CONT * Louis Alexandre de Bourbon, Comte de Toulouse was born illegitimately on 6 June 1678 at Clagny, France.  He was the son of Louis XIV, Roi de France and Françoise Athénaïs de Rochechouart. , He married Marie Victoire Sophe de Noa
2 CONC illes, daughter of Anne Jules de Noailles, Duc de Noailles and Marie Françoise de Bournonville, on 2 February 1723 at Paris, France. 
2 CONT * He died on 1 December 1737 at age 59 at Château de Rambouillet, Île-de-France, France. 
2 CONT * Louis Alexandre de Bourbon, Comte de Toulouse gained the title of Comte de Toulouse. In November 1681 his birth was legitimised. He gained the rank of Grand Admiral of France. 
2 CONT * Child of Louis Alexandre de Bourbon, comte de Toulouse and Marie Victoire Sophe de Noailles
2 CONT # Louis Jean Marie de Bourbon, Duc de Penthièvre+  b. 16 Nov 1725, d. 4 Mar 1793
2 CONT
