2 CONT      Philippe Charles d'Orléans, Duc de Valois was born on 16 July 1664 at Fontainebleau, Île-de-France, France. (2) He was the son of Philippe I, Duc d'Orléans and Henrietta Anne Stuart. (1) He died on 8 December 1666 at age 2 at
