2 CONC th+her+husband+Charles+V,+Duke+of+Lorraine+when+he+went+to+battle&source=bl&ots=WUeq2WfzOI&sig=ACfU3U3KFT-4u99AG-fPzJ2uMetQs6dZiw&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwimqtzXkrLgAhWzHjQIHeCxAa4Q6AEwBXoECAMQAQ#v=onepage&q=%20Charles%20V%2C%20Duke%
2 CONC 20of%20Lorraine%20and%20Bar&f=false
2 CONT * 1911 Encyclopædia Britannica/Charles V. or IV. (Duke of Lorraine) - https://en.m.wikisource.org/wiki/1911_Encyclopædia_Britannica/Charles_V._or_IV._(Duke_of_Lorraine)
2 CONT * Charles V, Duke of Lorraine - https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_V,_Duke_of_Lorraine
