1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Antonio Pantaleon de TAMEZ155 was born (date unknown). Parents: Juan Antonio TAMEZ and Catarina RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria Estefana PRIETO. Maria Estefana PRIETO and Antonio Pantaleon de TAMEZ were married after 19 July 1746.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b215.html#P9148
2 CONT ===============================
2 CONT 193. ANTONIO-PANTALEON7 DE TAMEZ-RODRIGUEZ (MARIA-CATARINA6 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, FRANCISCO5, DIEGO4, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) was born 1730. He married MARIA-ESTEFANA PRIETO-AGUIRR
2 CONC E 13 Feb 1747 in Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of PEDRO PRIETO-DE-VILLELA and FRANCISCA DE AGUIRRE. She was born 1728.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for ANTONIO-PANTALEON DE TAMEZ-RODRIGUEZ and MARIA-ESTEFANA PRIETO-AGUIRRE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 117.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANTONIO-PANTALEON DE TAMEZ-RODRIGUEZ and MARIA-ESTEFANA PRIETO-AGUIRRE are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 444. i. MARIA-LUISA8 TAMEZ-PRIETO, b. 28 Aug 1749, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JUAN-JOSEPH TAMEZ-PRIETO, b. 06 Feb 1752, Santiago Apostol, Santiago, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MARIA TERESA DE-LA-GARZA-SALDIVAR, 30 Oct 1782, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. JUAN-JOSEPH-DIONISIO TAMEZ-PRIETO, b. 21 Apr 1757, Nuestra Sra de Guadalupe, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
