1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Los Origens De La Familia Olivares by Zacarias Joel Olivarez (webcached 2/2/2013):
2 CONT
2 CONT http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/o/l/i/Zacarias--J-Olivarez/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0036.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Don Bartolome Garcia (b. Abt. 1735, d. Abt. 1800)
2 CONT
2 CONT Don Bartolome Garcia 
2 CONT *(son of Francisco Garcia and Maria Gertrudis Guaxardo) was born Abt. 1735 in Seville Spain, and 
2 CONT *died Abt. 1800 in Camargo Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married Maria De La Luz De La Garza on Abt. 1760 in Camargo Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Don Bartolome Garcia can be found in the 1757 Census for Camargo Mexico. There were two kinds of settlers that were originators of Camargo, those with government aid and those without government aid. Don Bartolome Garcia was one o
2 CONC f those well enough to do that he did not need government aid. The 1757 Camargo Census shows that he and his wife Juana Maria de la Luz Garza had two children, Josepa and Pedro, and the had all forms of weapons of that time.
2 CONT *C= caballos or horses. It shows that he had 8 horses
2 CONT *B= Burros. It shows that he owned 2 burros or donkeys/mules
2 CONT *Ba= Female Burros He had none
2 CONT *He had no servants and he received no aid.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Don Bartolome Garcia and Maria De La Luz De La Garza are:
2 CONT *1. Maria Gertrudis Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1761, Rancho Miralejos Mexico Porcion 30, 
2 CONT **d. date unknown.
2 CONT *2. Nicolas Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1762, Rancho Miralejos Mexico Porcion 30, 
2 CONT **d. date unknown.
2 CONT *3. +Pedro Ignacio Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1763, Camargo Mexico, 
2 CONT **d. Abt. 1830, Camargo Mexico.
2 CONT *4. Maria Teresa Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1764, Rancho Miralejos Mexico Porcion 30, 
2 CONT **d. date unknown.
2 CONT *5. Jose Matias Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1765, Rancho Miralejos Mexico Porcion 30, 
2 CONT **d. date unknown.
2 CONT *6. Jose Bruno Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1766, Rancho Miralejos Mexico Porcion 30, 
2 CONT **d. date unknown.
2 CONT *7. Maria Antonia Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1767, Rancho Miralejos Mexico Porcion 30, 
2 CONT **d. date unknown.
2 CONT *8. +Josefa Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1768, Camargo Mexico, 
2 CONT **d. 24 Dec 1797, Rancho La Bonita near Camargo Mexico.
2 CONT *9. Maria Leonor Garcia, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1768, Rancho Miralejos Mexico Porcion 30, 
2 CONT **d. date unknown.
