2 CONT *He married MARIA-MARGARITA DE-LA-PENA-GUAJARDO, 
2 CONT **daughter of JOSEPH-JACINTO DE-LA-PENA and ANA-MARIA GUAJARDO-GUTIERREZ-DE-CASTRO. She was born 1721 in Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died 28 Jun 1804 in Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for CAPTAIN JOSEPH-FLORENCIO DE CHAPA-BENAVIDES: He, his wife and children are listed on the March 3rd, 1753 census, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSEPH-FLORENCIO DE CHAPA-BENAVIDES and MARIA-MARGARITA DE-LA-PENA-GUAJARDO are:
2 CONT *1. i. FRANCISCO5 CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1740; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-ROSALIA LOPEZ; 
2 CONT ***b. Camargo, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *2. ii. MARIA-ANA-GERTRUDIS CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1742; 
2 CONT **m. JOSE-JULIAN GUTIERREZ-MALDONADO, 23 Mar 1772, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. Cerralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT *3. iii. JUAN CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1743.
2 CONT *4. iv. MARIA-GERTRUDIS CHAPA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1745.
2 CONT *5. v. MARIA-ROSALIA CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1748; 
2 CONT **m. JOSEPH-ANTONIO RAMOS-CANALES, 11 Jun 1776, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *6. vi. JOSE-LEONORDO CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1751; 
2 CONT **d. 14 May 1772.
2 CONT *7. vii. JOSEPH-SANTIAGO CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1752; 
2 CONT **m. JUANA-MARIA HINOJOSA, 28 Jan 1777, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *8. viii. JOAQUIN CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1750, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-TOMASA BAEZ-DE-BENAVIDES-CUELLAR, 13 Feb 1776, Revilla, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *9. ix. MARIA-LUISA CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **m. JOSEPH-ANTONIO GUERRA-DE-LA-GARZA, 13 Jan 1776, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *10. x. JOSE-ANTONIO CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **d. 21 Mar 1772, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
2 CONT *11. xi. JOSE-ESTABAN CHAPA-DE-LA-PENA, 
2 CONT **b. 1761; 
2 CONT **m. MARIA-JULIANA GUTIERREZ, 1794, Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico.
