2 ADDR
3 CITY San Juan Bautista
3 STAE California
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1740
2 ADDR
3 CITY Navojoa
3 STAE Sonora
3 CTRY Mexico
1 DEAT
2 DATE 21 DEC 1822
