1 CONT King Charles II Stuart of England was born on 29 May 1630 in St. James' Palace, London, England. (44) <fowsrc.htm> He died on 6 Feb 1685 in Whitehall Palace, London, England. He was buried in Westminster Abbey, London, England. Pa
1 CONC rents: King Charles I Stuart of England and Queen Henrietta Maria Bourbon
1 CONT He was married to Catherine of Braganza <d63.htm>.
1 CONT He was married to Eleanor (Nell) Gwynne <d173.htm>.
1 CONT He was married to Lucy Walter <d371.htm>. Children were: Duke James Scott of Monmouth <d328.htm>.
