1 CONT death in March of 1702. Then Mary's sister, Anne became Queen, as there were
1 CONT no children from his marriage to Mary II.
0 @N6000000002176675799@ NOTE Ruled jointly with Mary 'til she died in 1694, then ruled alone 'til his
